WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Sections name the parts of your song: intro, verse, chorus.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.400
Click Sections. The first section covers the beat.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.600
Click the plus to add the next one, eight bars long.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:24.400
Ctrl+drag a section to copy it with everything in it. The rest moves along.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:30.200
Press Play: the beat now plays in both copies.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.800
Right-click a section to rename it, loop it, or turn sections into scenes.
